		<section id="faq" class="py-32 bg-jungle-800 border-y border-white/5">
			<div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
				<div class="text-center mb-16">
					<p class="text-rice-400 text-[10px] tracking-[0.4em] uppercase mb-6 font-bold">FAQ</p>
					<h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white tracking-tighter">Good Questions.</h2>
				</div>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10">
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">What&#8217;s the fitness level?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">Moderate. Expect early starts, a few short hikes (30&#8211;60 mins), and some uneven paths. Nothing extreme, but you should be comfortable being active each day. A full packing guide and physical expectations breakdown will be included in your Welcome Dossier.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">How do rooms work?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">Choose twin share or private. Couples can share; solo guests can book a private room.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">Is this a group tour?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">It&#8217;s a hosted expedition with a tight group and a flexible flow. Think friends on a road trip with a local insider running logistics. That&#8217;s why we have a quick vetting call before you book&#8212;to make sure the group energy is right for everyone.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">What about safety?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">Every route is pre-scouted, transport is private, and timing avoids crowds. Comprehensive travel insurance is mandatory for all guests&#8212;we&#8217;ll cover exactly what you need in your Welcome Dossier.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">What about visas?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">Australians receive a Visa on Arrival (VOA) at Bali airport&#8212;it takes about 5 minutes and costs ~$35 AUD. Your Welcome Dossier will include a complete visa and customs guide so there are zero surprises at the border.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">What&#8217;s the weather like in April?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">April is ideal&#8212;it&#8217;s the transition from wet to dry season. The landscapes are lush and green, waterfalls are at full power, and the crowds haven&#8217;t arrived yet. Expect warm days (27&#8211;30&#176;C) with the occasional afternoon shower in the mountains.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">Can you cater to dietary needs?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">With largely 4&#8211;5 star accommodation, our hotels are well-equipped to handle most dietary requirements. That said, Bali isn&#8217;t as accustomed to specific dietary needs as the West, so let us know in advance and we&#8217;ll do our best to accommodate.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="reveal">
						<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-white mb-4">How does payment work?</h3>
						<p class="text-mist-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">A 20% deposit secures your spot after our vetting call. Full payment is due by March 1, 2026. We&#8217;ll walk through the details on our call.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="text-center mt-12">
					<a href="#apply" class="inline-block border border-white/30 text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-sm font-medium text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] hover:bg-white hover:text-jungle-900 transition-all">
						Chat with James
					</a>
				</div>
			</div>
